---
source: crates/standout-test/tests/harness_observation.rs
expression: result.stdout_plain()
---
Keep short notes

USAGE
  notes [OPTIONS]
       notes [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

COMMANDS
  list          List the notes
  help          Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

OPTIONS
  -f, --file <PATH>          Notes file to read
  --all                      Include archived notes
  --output <MODE>            Output format
                             default: auto
                             possible values: auto, term, text, term-debug, json, yaml, csv
  --output-file-path <PATH>  Write output to file instead of stdout
  -h, --help                 Print help
